      "filename": "Gutenberg Bible, Lenox Copy, New York Public Library, 2009. Pic 01.jpg",
      "title": "File:Gutenberg Bible, Lenox Copy, New York Public Library, 2009. Pic 01.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b6/Gutenberg_Bible%2C_Lenox_Copy%2C_New_York_Public_Library%2C_2009._Pic_01.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gutenberg_Bible,_Lenox_Copy,_New_York_Public_Library,_2009._Pic_01.jpg",
