      "filename": "Ceremonies - Salutes and Parades - New York - Alter at New York Public Library - NARA - 26423547.jpg",
      "title": "File:Ceremonies - Salutes and Parades - New York - Alter at New York Public Library - NARA - 26423547.jpg",
