      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ceremonies_-_Salutes_and_Parades_-_New_York_-_Alter_at_New_York_Public_Library_-_NARA_-_26423547.jpg",
      "width": 8088,
